# Krang, Utrom Warlord: "Other artifact creatures you control have flying, trample, indestructible, and haste."
# Bot1's Painter's Servant, cast on turn 5 after Krang, attacks the turn it arrives and flies over Bot2's own
# Painter's Servant. The grant reaches only artifacts that are creatures and only Bot1's: Bot1's Llanowar Elves (a
# creature, not an artifact), its Moxes (artifacts, not creatures) and Bot2's Painter's Servant have nothing.
# Bot2's Wrath of God on turn 6 then destroys all creatures: Krang and Bot1's Servant are indestructible and stay,
# while the Elves and Bot2's Servant die.

